EW API FORMATTED COMMENT
TYPE LIBRARY

LIBRARY  EWDB_APPLICATIONS

SUB_LIBRARY get_transfunc

LOCATION THIS_FILE

LINK_NAME Details
LINK details.html

#LINK_NAME Sample Config File
#LINK get_transfunc.d.txt

#LINK_NAME Programmer Notes
#LINK programmer_notes.txt

DESCRIPTION <b>get_transfunc</b> is a simple test program
that can be used to retrieve the Poles and Zeroes based
cooked transfer function for a channel (at a given time)
from an EWDB.  It takes the id of the channel, connection
parameters, and optionally time, as command line parameters, 
and dumps the function to standard out.
<br><br>
Initial version  2000/02/15 lucky
